# ============================================================
# ConnectSphere — Frontend environment (Vite)
#
# Copy to `.env` and fill in what you need:
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# IMPORTANT: every VITE_* variable is embedded into the JavaScript bundle and
# is therefore PUBLIC. Never put a secret here — only keys that are meant to
# be client-visible (like a GIF search key scoped to search).
# ============================================================

# ── KLIPY — GIF search for the chat picker (optional) ───────────
# Free tier, no credit card. Sign up at https://klipy.com/developers
# (Partner Panel → API keys). Ads are an optional monetisation add-on, NOT a
# requirement for using the API.
#
# Why Klipy and not Tenor/Giphy:
#   · Google is DISCONTINUING the Tenor API on 30 June 2026 and stopped
#     issuing new keys on 13 Jan 2026 — you can no longer get one.
#   · Giphy's free beta key is rate-limited and not permitted in production;
#     production access is a paid, approval-gated plan.
#   · Klipy was founded by ex-Tenor engineers with a near-identical API and a
#     genuinely free tier. WhatsApp migrated to it; Bluesky is following.
#
# The GIF tab works WITHOUT this key — it falls back to OtakuGIFs (keyless,
# ~46 reaction categories) and then to 24 built-in animated SVG cards. Set the
# key to unlock full free-text GIF search.
VITE_KLIPY_KEY=
